# On-brand UI only

Do not invent new section skins, class prefixes, or CSS files for homepage blocks.

Reuse what is already in `src/app/wowdesign-miami.css` (`pricing-single`, `pricing-price`, `layout237`, `cta`, `features-typography-card`, tagline chip, `section-title`, `InnerButton`).

`id` on a section is fine. A new look is not. Andy rejected off-brand Problem/Offer drafts on 2026-08-24.
